# Who reviews what (Roostack's SPEC.md §8.3.4): a pull request needs the
# approval of an owner of every file it changes, once the main branch
# requires reviews from code owners.
#
# The registry's maintainers own everything: the packages, every
# registry.yaml (a package's tier, maintainers and withdrawals), keys/
# and .github/. Once community packages open, each community package's
# folder also gets its own maintainers here, and its registry.yaml stays
# the registry maintainers' alone:
#
#   /packages/<name>/                @roostack/registry-maintainers @<its maintainers>
#   /packages/<name>/registry.yaml   @roostack/registry-maintainers
*   @roostack/registry-maintainers
